      "start": 0.1,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "transcript": "The recipe can stay the same.",
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "chocolate-crystal-choice.asset.same-recipe-different-structure.script.recipe",
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "samples": 56400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "chocolate-cue-2",
      "file": "audio/chocolate/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 2.6,
      "duration": 2.25,
      "transcript": "The chocolate doesn’t have to.",
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "chocolate-crystal-choice.asset.same-recipe-different-structure.script.recipe",
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "samples": 54000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "chocolate-cue-3",
      "file": "audio/chocolate/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 5.133333333333334,
      "duration": 4.35,
      "transcript": "Chocolate contains cocoa butter, a fat that forms crystals.",
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "chocolate-crystal-choice.asset.same-recipe-different-structure.script.fat",
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "samples": 104400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "chocolate-cue-4",
      "file": "audio/chocolate/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 9.733333333333333,
      "duration": 3.525,
      "transcript": "Melt it enough, and that crystal structure breaks down.",
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "chocolate-crystal-choice.asset.same-recipe-different-structure.script.melt",
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "samples": 84600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "chocolate-cue-5",
      "file": "audio/chocolate/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 13.6,
      "duration": 2.65,
      "transcript": "As it cools, crystals form again.",
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "chocolate-crystal-choice.asset.same-recipe-different-structure.script.arrange",
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "samples": 63600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
